# Dirty read-sharing: core 0 writes a line, cores 1-3 then read it.
# Isolates the O state: MOSI/MOESI keep the dirty line in cache,
# MSI/MESI flush it to memory on every hand-off.

0 0 W 0x200000
0 1 R 0x200000
0 2 R 0x200000
0 3 R 0x200000
0 0 W 0x200040
0 1 R 0x200040
0 2 R 0x200040
0 3 R 0x200040
0 0 W 0x200080
0 1 R 0x200080
0 2 R 0x200080
0 3 R 0x200080
